  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Skyblock_Builder/BH_SB_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"411\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Skyblock_Builder/BH_SB_Ultimate.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"84\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">此模组允许您通过配置文件创建自定义空岛。&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">您只需使用原版Minecraft中的结构方块，或结构保存物品创建示意图文件，并设置岛屿的潜在生成点。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">此模组在服务器和客户端均需安装。在客户端创建新世界时，它会在\"更多世界选项...\"设置中添加一个\"空岛\"世界类型。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">对于服务器，请在server.properties或forge-common.toml（配置）中将世界类型设置为\"skyblockbuilder:custom_skyblock\"（1.18+版本： \"skyblockbuilder:skyblock\"）。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">此模组需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libx\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibX</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">帮助翻译此模组，请前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foss5m9q.oneskyapp.com%252fadmin%252fproject%252fdashboard%252fproject%252f177200\" rel=\"nofollow\">One Sky平台</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Skyblock_Builder/BH_SB_Overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"84\"></p><p><em>音质略低且为德语，但或许有帮助</em></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vcxpt3WnxvM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fmelanx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Skyblock_Builder/BH_SB_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"169\"></span></a><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">#广告 #Ad</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
